  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "遊園地（芝生）",
    "id": "2064",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「んん、すごい人波だね。息が詰まっちゃうよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いつも、こうなのかな。遊園地にきたことないから、よくわからないけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、この町のことまだあんまり詳しくないかもだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「このへんはうちの学校の周辺だと、いちばんおおきなデートスポット……あぁいや、遊び場でね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「水族館とか動物園とかが、集まってるんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「この遊園地はいちばん古い施設で、乗り物とか内装とかけっこう老朽化してるからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「いつもは、閑古鳥が鳴いてるって話だったんだけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「噂なんか『あて』にならないね、けっこうな人混みだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「人気のアトラクションは大行列ができてて、乗れそうにないけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしとしては、逆に助かっちゃってるな。ジェットコースターとか連続で乗るのは、きついもん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ゆったりしたメリーゴーランドとかのほうが空いてるし耐えられるし、いい感じだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ほら、たくさん写真も撮っちゃった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「カボチャの馬車に乗った転校生くん、着ぐるみと並んでピースしてる転校生くん……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「午前中だけでけっこう廻れたけど、まだまだ乗ってないのいっぱいあるね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「でも遊園地そのものが広いから、歩き回るだけで疲れちゃったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、ちゃんと楽しめてるかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「男の子はもっとこう、派手で刺激的なやつのほうが好きなんじゃない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ごめんね。わたしの都合にあわせて、ゆるいのにしか乗せてあげられなくて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「何か乗りたいのあったら、ひとりで行ってきてもいいよ。わたし、ベンチで休んでるから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたしが、ふつうの身体だったらな。もっと、元気だったらよかったのにな」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「コホ、コホ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「でも、がんばるよ。午後もいっぱい遊ぼうね〜、その前に腹ごしらえしよっか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「このへんの芝生で休みがてら、お昼ご飯にしようよ。お弁当つくってきたんだ〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「持ちこみ自由みたいだったからね、この遊園地。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「敷地内のレストランはお高価いし、どこも混んでるっぽいから……ちょうどいいでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「転校生くん、レジャーシート敷いてくれる？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「わたし、お弁当とか飲み物とかの準備しちゃうから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ほら見て、けっこうがんばったんだよお弁当。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「くるみちゃんに、料理のコツとか教わったんだ〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「って、そんなに怯えないでよ。くるみちゃん、料理の知識とか豊富なんだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「最近ほんとに、がんばってるみたいだし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「まぁ。わたし普段はあんまり料理とかしないから、簡単なものしかつくれなかったけどね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「サンドイッチと〜♪　おにぎりと〜♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ありゃ、唐揚げがないな。転校生くん、もう食べちゃったの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「リンゴもないな……う〜ん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
