    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「むぐっ！　ごほっ、ごほげほっ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あぁっ、急いで食べるからっ。噎せちゃったんだね……はい、お水♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「ごく、ごく。ふう、助かりました。ありがとうございます」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「わたし、朝から何も食べてなくて。この芝生で、ぶっ倒れてたんですが。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "「目の前においしそうなお弁当が並べられて、つい我慢できずに……ごめんなさい！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "old-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 12,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「その前に、えぇっと。あなた、誰だったかな。見覚えはあるんだけど、同じ学校の子かな……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-civvies2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-civvies2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
